---
// 扁平卡片：無陰影、無圓角。空間感靠色塊（fill）或細線框（outline）。
interface Props {
	variant?: "fill" | "outline";
	class?: string;
}
const { variant = "fill", class: extra = "" } = Astro.props;

const variants = {
	fill: "bg-surface", // 用 surface 色塊圈出一組
	outline: "border border-ink/10", // 用 hairline 細線框出一組
};
---

<div class={`rounded-card p-8 ${variants[variant]} ${extra}`}>
	<slot />
</div>
